# VoltPhone headless script: tap into each of the three screens from the home
# grid and back out through the nav-bar chevron. Coordinates are window-space
# for the fixed 500x900 window: the device frame is centred, so the first
# home-grid row sits at y=160 (Settings 131, Contacts 210, Photos 289) and the
# back chevron's 44x44 tap box is centred at (109, 124).
move 131 160
click 131 160
move 110 122
click 110 122
move 210 160
click 210 160
move 110 122
click 110 122
move 289 160
click 289 160
move 110 122
click 110 122
close
